It's fairly easy to implement, just tried it with refinement list, it's working well.
One thing to note is that it needs autoHide to be true to have a good experience

For reference this is the code needed to do it

```
if (facetValues.length === 0) {
        facetValues = helper.getRefinements(facetName).map(function(facet) {
          return {
            count: 0,
            isRefined: true,
            name: facet.value,
            url: //fixme
          };
        });
      }
```
